# Known bug: the lore counter a player puts on their Saga as their precombat main phase begins (CR 714.3c, "that player
# puts a lore counter") has no player putting it in the engine, so "If you would put one or more counters" (Innkeeper's
# Talent, level 3) does not double it (KI-46).
#
# Summon: Esper Maduin enters on turn 5 (Esper Origins flashed back) with one lore counter, before Innkeeper's Talent
# reaches level 3 later that turn. On turn 7 Bot1 puts the turn's lore counter on it, and the Talent doubles it to two
# (CR 614.1a, 122.6): from one to three, chapters II and III trigger together (CR 714.2c) and Bot1 orders them, III on
# top. (The finality counter put on as it entered was not doubled either way: the Talent was then at level 2.)

